invariant: INV-35
file: build.c
catches: test/lib-check-webpki-tcp-nonblocking.sh
reason: build.c records sizeof(ch_tls) as a number, 1144, the default
  object's size on a 64-bit host, rather than computing it. The number
  is right for one build and stale for every other, the TRUST=webpki
  tcp-nonblocking object among them, whose ch_tls is 3,048 bytes. lib-check
  links test/build_test.c under that object's own defines, and the
  consumer reads 1144 where its headers compute 3,048, so it objects.

--- old
    .sizeof_ch_tls = CH_BUILD_SIZEOF_CH_TLS,
--- new
    .sizeof_ch_tls = 1144,
